# first-run.out -- the first version of two-word.tcl (flag form only, DEPTH 4
# with kind, ic3 and ric3 at 60 s), stopped by hand during its DEPTH 16
# part to make room for the position form. Seconds as printed.
=== A: DEPTH 4
--- informal-kind, limit 60s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
m_d                          assume  unprocessed              
m_one1                       assume  unprocessed              
m_one2                       assume  unprocessed              
a_order                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_once1                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
a_once2                      assert  undetermined             no engine reached a verdict
c_both                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 3 in 0.02 s
